    {
        "content": "<p>Here are the relevant compilation and instantiation outputs:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Markdown\"><pre><span></span><code>compilation :: cycles :: Sum Total\n\n    Δ = 58049625.00 ± 15633925.73 (confidence = 95%)\n\n    main-65abe37.so is 1.00x to 1.00x faster than branch-a84af50.so!\n\n    ┌─────────────┬─────────────┬────────────────┬─────────────┬───────────────────┐\n    │ Min         │ Max         │ Mean           │ Median      │ Engine            │\n    ├─────────────┼─────────────┼────────────────┼─────────────┼───────────────────┤\n    │ 25124565480 │ 25415452320 │ 25216860674.40 │ 25199541210 │ branch-a84af50.so │\n    ├─────────────┼─────────────┼────────────────┼─────────────┼───────────────────┤\n    │ 25069587720 │ 25349387520 │ 25158811049.40 │ 25156585590 │ main-65abe37.so   │\n    └─────────────┴─────────────┴────────────────┴─────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\ncompilation :: cycles :: shootout-keccak\n\n    Δ = 597369.60 ± 452616.40 (confidence = 95%)\n\n    main-65abe37.so is 1.00x to 1.01x faster than branch-a84af50.so!\n\n    ┌──────────┬──────────┬─────────────┬──────────┬───────────────────┐\n    │ Min      │ Max      │ Mean        │ Median   │ Engine            │\n    ├──────────┼──────────┼─────────────┼──────────┼───────────────────┤\n    │ 76410240 │ 83379810 │ 77973418.80 │ 77263950 │ branch-a84af50.so │\n    ├──────────┼──────────┼─────────────┼──────────┼───────────────────┤\n    │ 76267080 │ 84486750 │ 77376049.20 │ 76783590 │ main-65abe37.so   │\n    └──────────┴──────────┴─────────────┴──────────┴───────────────────┘\ncompilation :: cycles :: rust-json\n\n    Δ = 1252661.40 ± 475001.68 (confidence = 95%)\n\n    main-65abe37.so is 1.00x to 1.01x faster than branch-a84af50.so!\n\n    ┌───────────┬───────────┬──────────────┬───────────┬───────────────────┐\n    │ Min       │ Max       │ Mean         │ Median    │ Engine            │\n    ├───────────┼───────────┼──────────────┼──────────