        "content": "<p>Hmm, the instantiation data is still quite noisy where it should be flat (unless I'm out-of-date here -- I know we refactored to put some more module init into Cranelift-compiled code, but I think most of the logic should still be in the Wasmtime runtime). What kind of system are you running on -- desktop? laptop? cloud VM? Any special measure to reduce noise? Can you see what happens if you increase iteration count?</p>",
